---
---

<section id="contacto" class="relative overflow-hidden py-28" aria-label="Contacto y demo">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-[30rem] w-[42rem] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-600/10 blur-[130px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div data-cta class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 px-8 py-16 text-center backdrop-blur-xl sm:px-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
      ¿Listo para escalar con
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-200 via-accent-400 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Kaido Group</span>?
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-slate-400">
      Agenda una demo personalizada y descubre cómo el ecosistema completo puede transformar
      tus ventas, pagos y marketing.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="#"
        data-magnetic
        class="rounded-full bg-accent-600 px-9 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-accent-600/30 transition-shadow hover:shadow-accent-600/50"
      >
        Agendar demo gratuita
      </a>
      <a
        href="#"
        data-magnetic
        class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-9 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Hablar con ventas
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
